sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant I as Issues
    participant ID as Identity
    participant DB as Issues DB
    participant P as Publisher
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notifications
    participant ND as Notifications DB
    participant T as Telegram
    FE->>I: POST /api/v1/issues + JWT
    I->>ID: GET /internal/v1/users/{userId}/housing
    ID-->>I: Room + block snapshot
    I->>DB: Issue NEW + History; COMMIT
    I-->>FE: 201 Issue
    P->>DB: History WHERE published_at IS NULL
    P->>Q: issue.created; eventId=History.id
    Q-->>P: Confirm + route checked
    P->>DB: Set History.published_at
    Q-->>N: Event
    N->>ND: Save / load Notification by eventId
    N->>T: sendMessage
    T-->>N: ok=true
    N->>ND: Set Notification.sent_at
    N->>Q: ACK
